verdicts: not yet reviewed

Asserts: gates passed. Test failures 7 -> 5 and credo 77 -> 76, both baselines lowered
in this commit. Dialyzer 43 held. The two ThreatIntel tests pass for the first time in
the project's history, and threat-driven promotion was verified end to end through the
real ingest path.

Does NOT assert: that any reviewer examined this diff. Nor that threat intel is useful
in practice -- the index holds four builtin keywords and there is no loader for a real
dataset, so this makes the mechanism work rather than making the product capable.

Note: a test's setup was changed to accommodate a production change (the ETS table
became :protected, so the test could no longer clear it directly). That is normally a
smell; the justification is recorded in PLAN.md. The behaviour assertions are unchanged.
